 private island in  the Caribbean along with homes in Paris  and New York City some estimates put the  value of what he left behind at hundreds  of millions of dollars  and Epstein's lawyers say they want a  review surveillance video from inside  the jail they say the facility was  operated under quote medieval conditions  still so many questions about how this  was able to happen yeah you know for the  women who just don't get any closure  exactly right now to a lot of suspicions  there Thank You Kenneth
 

